1
00:00:09,207 --> 00:00:11,552
Oh, you followed me?

2
00:00:12,748 --> 00:00:14,366
Didn't you say you were going to buy food?

3
00:00:14,366 --> 00:00:19,955
Damn, I was just crossing to the cafeteria.
Isn't it closed already?

4
00:00:21,196 --> 00:00:23,400
But the drink stalls are still open.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,975
You could've eaten under the building
so BB can see you.

6
00:00:28,932 --> 00:00:31,975
They don't have slushy Coke.
What's wrong with you?

7
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:40,236
Who are you looking for?
Mind your business.

8
00:00:45,559 --> 00:00:47,460
What are you waiting for?

9
00:00:48,327 --> 00:00:49,262
Why?

10
00:00:49,665 --> 00:00:52,393
Well, you're scared of the dark, right?

11
00:00:54,710 --> 00:00:59,050
That's my business. Aren't you waiting for BB?
Shouldn't you go pick her up?

12
00:00:59,050 --> 00:01:07,680
- Not yet. She'll message me when she's done.
- Yeah…

13
00:01:07,680 --> 00:01:10,646
Hey, what are you looking at?

14
00:01:10,646 --> 00:01:12,961
Nothing. My business.

15
00:01:12,961 --> 00:01:15,654
- Hey, Earth.
- Oh, hi Night.

16
00:01:17,448 --> 00:01:19,416
Did you wait long?

17
00:01:19,416 --> 00:01:24,120
- Not long.
- A car was blocking the way, so I was a bit late.

18
00:01:24,898 --> 00:01:27,507
Is Tawan coming too?

19
00:01:28,823 --> 00:01:30,164
Who's coming.

20
00:01:30,747 --> 00:01:33,688
Tawan made plans with his girlfriend.
It's just the two of us.

21
00:01:33,808 --> 00:01:39,375
They still haven't broken up?
